<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 3	 Dec 2	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.370     242.030     237.040    2.11 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.750     303.850     303.640    0.07 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.780     157.100     165.490   -5.07 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.326	46.318	48.410   -4.32 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  409.080     408.100     366.280   11.42 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.715     140.015     147.886   -5.32 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.984	15.961	14.975    6.58 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.210     213.020     230.135   -7.44 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.864	 1.865	 1.939   -3.82 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.557	 1.575   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.095     184.635     206.030  -10.38 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
